sourceHMAC.description:
HMAC mode only. Exactly one sha256=<64 hex digits> header. HMAC-SHA256 with the source secret (32–4096 bytes) over UTF-8 bytes: WebhookControl/v1
{source_id}
{Idempotency-Key}
{X-Webhook-Timestamp}
{raw body}. Each 
 means one LF; braces are substitutions. Body whitespace is signed; no extra newline is appended. Source, key and canonical timestamp are signed. Comparisons are constant-time.
